<section class="wrap" id="faq">
  <span class="eyebrow">Questions</span>
  <h2>WhatsApp AI chatbot questions, answered</h2>
  <div style="margin-top:1.6rem">
    <details open><summary>What is Omnexa?</summary>
      <p>Omnexa combines an AI chatbot and GEO analysis for small and medium businesses in Malaysia. Paid plans start from RM 89 per month equivalent on a 12-month prepaid term.</p></details>
    <details><summary>How much does a WhatsApp AI chatbot cost with Omnexa?</summary>
      <p>For a one-month term, Essential costs RM 133.50, Advanced RM 283.50 and Pro RM 561.00. Lower monthly equivalents are available for 3, 6 and 12-month prepaid terms. Every new account starts with a 7-day Free trial, with no card required.</p></details>
    <details><summary>How do I add an AI chatbot to my business WhatsApp?</summary>
      <p>Sign up, then connect your number through the official WhatsApp Cloud API or a linked device. Upload PDFs or add your website pages, and Omnexa starts answering customers from that content and saving each conversation to its CRM.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Where does the chatbot get its answers?</summary>
      <p>From the documents you upload and the website pages you add, rather than general knowledge, so replies reflect what your business has actually published.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Can my staff reply instead of the bot?</summary>
      <p>Yes. Every conversation lands in one inbox next to its CRM record, with tags, status and staff assignment, so your team can read the full history and reply to the customer directly.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Can customers book appointments through the chat?</summary>
      <p>Yes. Once you switch bookings on for a chatbot, it collects booking requests in the chat. Your staff confirm each request, and the full list downloads as a CSV file.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Which channels does Omnexa support?</summary>
      <p>WhatsApp (through the official Cloud API or a linked device), Telegram and a chat widget for your own website are live today. Instagram, Facebook, X and LinkedIn are in development and are not included in any plan yet.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Do I need a Meta Business account?</summary>
      <p>Yes, for the WhatsApp Cloud API. Telegram needs only a bot token, which takes about a minute to create, and the website chat needs no outside account.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Which AI models does Omnexa use?</summary>
      <p>Essential includes GPT-6 Luna and Gemini 3.8 Flash. Advanced adds Claude Haiku 4.5. Pro includes GPT-6.1 Sol, Claude Sonnet 5.5 and Gemini 3.1 Pro. The 7-day free trial uses one entry model. On paid plans you choose which included model each chatbot uses.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Berapakah harga chatbot AI WhatsApp untuk bisnes di Malaysia?</summary>
      <p>Omnexa menggabungkan chatbot AI dan analisis GEO untuk perniagaan di Malaysia. Pelan berbayar bermula daripada nilai bulanan RM 89 dengan tempoh prabayar 12 bulan. Setiap akaun baharu bermula dengan percubaan percuma 7 hari, tanpa kad.</p></details>
  </div>
</section>

